  "prefLabel": "Plc 2005.04 Processing of Renewal Applications; Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2005.04 Processing of Renewal Applications; Decisions.\n\n(a) The licensing bureau shall process the application as provided in Plc 308.09.\n\n(b) An applicant may withdraw the application for certification renewal at any time prior to being notified of a decision under Plc 308.11 by proceeding in accordance with Plc 308.10.\n\n(c) The licensing bureau shall review complete applications, make decisions, and notify applicants in accordance with Plc 308.11.\n\n(d) The licensing bureau shall issue a renewal certification if the applicant:\n\n(1) Has submitted a renewal application in accordance with Plc 2005.03;\n\n(2) Meets the requirements for renewal stated in Plc 2005.01; and\n\n(3) Has not been shown, through an adjudicative proceeding, to have engaged in an act that would result in denial under RSA 326-N:5, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
